  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Thinly slice capsicum.  </li>\n• <li>In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.</li>\n• <li>Cook capsicum, until tender, 5-6 minutes. Transfer to a large bowl and allow to cool slightly. </li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a2654cc36343f76875e91b4/step-00015000.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Meanwhile, roughly chop cucumber and slice lemon into wedges.</li>\n• <li>Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a2654cc36343f76875e91b4/step-8f0ef610.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Microwave flatbreads on a plate in 10 second bursts until warmed through. </li>\n• <li>When the capsicum is done, wipe out frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.</li>\n• <li>Cook haloumi untill golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.</li>\n• <li>Remove pan from heat, add the honey, a pinch of chilli flakes (if using) and a good squeeze of lemon juice, turning haloumi to coat. </li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a2654cc36343f76875e91b4/step-12fcfe20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>To bowl with cooled capsicum, add spinach &amp; rocket mix, cucumber, a drizzle of olive oil and vinegar. Season and toss to combine. </li>\n• <li>Divide flatbreads, capsicum salad, honey haloumi and Greek-style yoghurt between plates. Tear over Dill.</li>\n• <li>Serve with any remaining salad and lemon wedges. Enjoy! </li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a2654cc36343f76875e91b4/step-03f4ca30.jpg"
    }
  ]
